Package: MaquerinaMundo
Type: Package
Title: Maquerina Mundo — Solarpunk dashboard for plants and climate
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alejandro", "Ines", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maquerina Mundo is a Shiny-based project and lightweight R package that explores
 relationships between plant growth and climate variables through interactive visualizations,
 mapping, and small analysis helpers. It bundles convenience functions for data loading,
 summary statistics, and plotting to support teaching, demos, and prototyping in a solarpunk
 aesthetic. This field intentionally provides a longer description to satisfy package
 metadata requirements and to give readers context about the project's goals and scope.
